      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SCRATCH DADDY (4) went straight to the front and never headed when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when finished 4th and beaten 5.5 lengths at this track (22.54). Key runner on his best form. WEST ON RICKY (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (17.91) in a Novice race at Northam. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from five starts. Great chance to atone. TINY VIOLIN (2) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 17 lengths sixth (30.95) last time in a Grade 5/6 at this track over 520m. Better than latest and worth another try. ON RED ALERT (7) is worth including after a top-three finish at big odds most recently.",
